'''Pretty Cat''' (プリティキャット, ''Purittikyatto'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Pretty Cat
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 219.png
|money drop = 666円 - 2,630円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has average stats all-round and not even a special ability to make up for it, nothing too special to note other than she appears as a basic peon in many of the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle & Dragon]] stages.

However in the [[Arena of Honor/Castle & Dragon And Dojo|Ranking Dojo]] stage she can appear as more of a threat than a peon due to the Dojo increasing her magnification to a maximum of 700%, making her health at 350,000 and attack of 18,662!

==Strategy==
As said before, treat this enemy like a peon. Decently ranged attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and more can deal a large amount of damage at a safe distance.

